From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fluorite Integration Role
Date: Mon, 20 Jul 2026 22:00:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] filament_scene: omit unsupported root cameras payload

The native scene deserializer does not consume the root-level cameras list.
Omit this unused payload so camera serialization cannot abort scene startup.
---
 packages/filament_scene/lib/scene/scene_widget.dart | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/packages/filament_scene/lib/scene/scene_widget.dart b/packages/filament_scene/lib/scene/scene_widget.dart
--- a/packages/filament_scene/lib/scene/scene_widget.dart
+++ b/packages/filament_scene/lib/scene/scene_widget.dart
@@ -178,1 +178,0 @@
-    _creationParams["cameras"] = widget.cameras?.map((final param) => param.toJson()).toList();

-- 
